@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. GET semua materi
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons

### 2. GET satu materi
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/solar-sun

### 3. GET materi yang tidak ada (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/tidak-ada

### 4. POST tambah materi (201)
# @name tambah
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Gerhana Bulan",
  "theme": "Fenomena Langit",
  "description": "Saat Bumi berada di antara Matahari dan Bulan.",
  "content": "Gerhana Bulan terjadi ketika bayangan Bumi menutupi Bulan.",
  "funFact": "Saat gerhana total, Bulan bisa tampak kemerahan.",
  "level": 1,
  "published": true,
  "publishedAt": "2026-11-20"
}

### 5. POST gagal validasi (400): judul terlalu pendek, tema tidak dikenal, level di luar batas
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "ab",
  "theme": "Dapur",
  "description": "ok",
  "level": 9
}

### 6. POST judul kembar (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Matahari, Pusat Tata Surya",
  "theme": "Tata Surya",
  "description": "Judul ini sudah ada di data awal."
}

### 7. PATCH ubah materi (jalankan nomor 4 dulu)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{tambah.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Deskripsi yang sudah diperbarui.",
  "level": 2
}

### 8. PATCH gagal validasi (400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{tambah.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "level": "tinggi"
}

### 9. DELETE hapus materi (jalankan nomor 4 dulu)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{tambah.response.body.id}}

### 10. DELETE lagi, sudah tidak ada (404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{tambah.response.body.id}}
